WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.016
"Follow those space bats!" Bot said.

2
00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:07.523
"I think they want to help us!"

3
00:00:07.524 --> 00:00:09.957
Ringo bit his lip.

4
00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:11.644
He looked at Lucy.

5
00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:32.385
She shrugged. "Let's do it."

6
00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:40.593
Everyone climbed up.

7
00:00:40.594 --> 00:00:43.777
They crawled through the hole.

8
00:00:43.778 --> 00:00:46.098
Space bats swooped.

9
00:00:46.099 --> 00:01:12.748
Ringo closed his eyes.

10
00:01:12.749 --> 00:01:22.312
Finally everyone slid down into a big room.

11
00:01:22.313 --> 00:01:26.814
Shiny gems sparkled.

12
00:01:26.815 --> 00:01:30.729
"Space Patrol!" a miner said.

13
00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:41.358
The miners were trapped under a machine.

14
00:01:41.359 --> 00:01:47.247
PJ and Bot lifted the machine.

15
00:01:47.248 --> 00:01:57.717
Ringo and Lucy pulled the miners out.

16
00:01:57.718 --> 00:02:03.692
Pebbles started to fall from the ceiling.

17
00:02:03.693 --> 00:02:06.914
Rocks were still blocking the tunnel.

18
00:02:06.915 --> 00:02:15.281
Bot and PJ were moving the rocks.

19
00:02:15.282 --> 00:02:21.805
"Bot, PJ, hurry!" Ringo said.

20
00:02:21.806 --> 00:02:24.832
Soon the tunnel was clear.

21
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:27.356
Everyone ran.

22
00:02:27.357 --> 00:02:36.126
The room caved in behind them. Crash!

23
00:02:36.127 --> 00:02:38.813
"Whew!" a miner said.

24
00:02:38.814 --> 00:02:41.900
Then a bat landed on him.

25
00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:46.749
"Cute little guy." The miner patted the bat.

26
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.364
The space bat chirped.

27
00:02:50.365 --> 00:03:02.307
Ringo laughed. "Space bats aren't scary after all!"

28
00:03:02.308 --> 00:03:08.226
Ringo found Captain Nova standing on her desk.

29
00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:12.215
"I, um, saw a cockroach."

30
00:03:12.216 --> 00:03:15.354
"Don't feel silly," Ringo said.

31
00:03:15.355 --> 00:03:25.829
"Everybody gets scared sometimes."

